{"id":"623794","name":"鲜虾苦菊沙拉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/623794/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"苦菊","amount":"80g"},{"name":"大虾","amount":"3只"}],"sub":[{"name":"全麦土司","amount":"3片"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"半匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"苦菊洗净。","img":"images/623794/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"沥干水分摆盘。","img":"images/623794/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鲜虾冷水下锅，野生海虾，清水煮就可以。","img":"images/623794/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把虾煮熟。","img":"images/623794/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"过冷水。","img":"images/623794/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取土司。","img":"images/623794/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"热锅冷油，油热放土司煎两面金黄即可。","img":"images/623794/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大虾去壳。","img":"images/623794/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放土司整理一下。","img":"images/623794/step_9.jpeg"},{"step":10,"desc":"磨一点海盐黑胡椒撒上边即可。","img":"images/623794/step_10.jpeg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/623794/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}